<#f0f000>SYSTEM</>

Forward Run                           _F_F
Back Dash                             _B_B
Double Jump                           _AIR_U
Throw <#bebebe>(close)</>              [_F/_B]_+^2P
Dodge                                 ^LP_+^LK
Forward / Back Roll                   [_F/_B]_+^LP_+^LK
Power Charge <#bebebe>(hold)</>        ^MP_+^MK
MAX Mode <#bebebe>(1000)</>            ^HP_+^HK
Advancing Guard <#bebebe>(guarding)</> ^2P
